00:06:17.944 --> 00:06:19.612
[ As Donald Trump ] "Strong!

00:06:19.612 --> 00:06:20.913
Uh, powerful!

00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:22.448
Ve-- very powerful!

00:06:22.448 --> 00:06:24.116
That would be
another word for me.

00:06:24.116 --> 00:06:26.018
If you want
to put that down for me."

00:06:26.018 --> 00:06:28.387
[ Normal voice ] And by the way,
that's the guy news networks

00:06:28.387 --> 00:06:30.990
have decided to air unfiltered
during a national emergency,

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.558
the guy who he can't even
read his own script.

00:06:32.558 --> 00:06:34.994
If that's the content you want,
cable networks,

00:06:34.994 --> 00:06:37.863
just take a live feed of
my grandpa at his next eye exam.

00:06:37.863 --> 00:06:39.731
And by the way,
it doesn't make it better

00:06:39.731 --> 00:06:41.800
when you give it
a negative chyron,

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.736 line:0%
like CNN did on Monday, with,

00:06:43.736 --> 00:06:46.472 line:0%
"Angry Trump turns briefing
into propaganda session."

00:06:46.472 --> 00:06:49.242 line:0%
You know what else turned that
into a propaganda session?

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:50.909
Pointing your camera at it.

00:06:50.909 --> 00:06:52.345
Before you showed up,
it was just,

00:06:52.345 --> 00:06:54.947
"Crazy lawn man does his thing."

00:06:54.947 --> 00:06:56.982
You can't air
a propaganda session

00:06:56.982 --> 00:06:58.116
