"Change the channel.

00:07:02.421 --> 00:07:04.223 line:0%
This show sucks."

00:07:04.223 --> 00:07:06.291 line:0%
And that is what it was,
a propaganda session.

00:07:06.291 --> 00:07:07.993
In fact, the White House edited

00:07:07.993 --> 00:07:10.596
