00:08:08.153 --> 00:08:10.022
Made you touch
your face again, Fauci.

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:11.424
This guy.

00:08:11.424 --> 00:08:12.959
Love you, Fauc."

00:08:12.959 --> 00:08:14.626
[ Normal voice ] Particularly,
Trump keeps touting his ban

00:08:14.626 --> 00:08:15.861
