You're so disgraceful.

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:47.559
It is so disgraceful
the way you say that.

00:08:47.559 --> 00:08:49.161
Let me just -- Listen.

00:08:49.161 --> 00:08:52.431
I just went over it.

00:08:52.431 --> 00:08:55.300
I just went over it.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.803
Nobody thought we should do it,

00:08:57.803 --> 00:08:59.104
