-You had cases in February.

00:09:10.082 --> 00:09:12.084
-Excuse me, you reported it.

00:09:12.084 --> 00:09:15.855
Zero cases, zero deaths
on January 17th.

00:09:15.855 --> 00:09:17.690
-In January.
February, the entire --

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:20.026
-Janua-- I said in January.
-Your video has a complete gap.

00:09:20.026 --> 00:09:21.460
-On January 3rd.

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:23.629
-What did the administration
do in February with the time

00:09:23.629 --> 00:09:24.996
that your travel ban bought you?

00:09:24.996 --> 00:09:26.165
-A lot.
-What?

00:09:26.165 --> 00:09:28.500
-A lot, and in fact,
we'll give you a list.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:29.735
-[ As Donald Trump ] "Dan?

00:09:29.735 --> 00:09:32.104
Dan, can you get us
that list you made

00:09:32.104 --> 00:09:33.906
