00:09:38.344 --> 00:09:40.412
The February list, Dan!

00:09:40.412 --> 00:09:43.815
It will be between
the January list

00:09:43.815 --> 00:09:45.350
and then the March list.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.619
Dan?

00:09:46.619 --> 00:09:49.054
